[TITLE]
CON-01: closed storage S1 (1000 ft2, full depth 10 ft, surcharge depth 5 ft) with no links,
10 cfs for 1 h, EXTRAN surcharge, 5 s steps. It is full at 1000 s (10,000 ft3);
the other 26,000 ft3 must flood. J1-C1-O1 is only there because SWMM needs an outfall.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:01:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         5
VARIABLE_STEP        0
SURCHARGE_METHOD     EXTRAN

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1     0    5        0         0        0

[OUTFALLS]
O1     -1   FREE

[STORAGE]
;;Name Elev MaxD InitD Shape     A1 A2 A0   SurDepth Fevap
S1     0    10   0     FUNCTIONAL 0  0  1000 5        0

[CONDUITS]
C1     J1  O1  100  0.013  0  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
S1  FLOW  ""  FLOW 1.0 1.0 10

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL

